Origin: EmberBSD, AI-assisted.
Remove mail/sendmail-snapshot. It packages sendmail 8.18.0.2, older
than mail/sendmail (8.18.2), and still uses databases/db and db4.
EmberBSD keeps one version per program. Not submitted upstream.

